  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold anti-immigrant sentiments and are politically aligned with or sympathetic to conservative or right-wing ideologies in the United States, particularly those who oppose immigration reform and view the Democratic Party as overly permissive toward undocumented immigrants. The meme is designed to resonate with viewers who perceive immigration policy as a zero-sum game and who are likely to be influenced by inflammatory rhetoric that equates granting rights to undocumented immigrants with 'taking rights' from citizens, using the fetus image as a loaded symbol to provoke emotional reactions and reinforce anti-immigrant narratives.",
